WEBVTT

00:03:57.121 --> 00:04:00.413
in 2009, Erin Scott had been working
for a bank in Florida

00:04:00.413 --> 00:04:03.954
for 14 years when he lost his
job during the recession.

00:04:04.204 --> 00:04:06.329
He started looking for
a new job in finance.

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:13.829
I would estimate that surely I applied
for at least two hundred jobs.

00:04:14.746 --> 00:04:17.288
I think I have like three interviews
in that whole time

00:04:17.538 --> 00:04:19.871
as more time passed without any callbacks

00:04:19.871 --> 00:04:24.204
and became more open to exploring other
roles and for lower pay as long

00:04:24.204 --> 00:04:25.246
as they were in state

00:04:25.496 --> 00:04:28.663
your station for one particular
kind of fish.

00:04:29.329 --> 00:04:34.663
But in time when you start casting your
net a whole lot wider feeling dejected.